         "step": 1,
         "text": "Let \\( u = x^{3} + 4 \\). Then \\( du = 3 x^{2}\\,dx \\), so the integrand is \\( 3 \\) times \\( \\cos{\\left(u \\right)} \\) du: \\( 3\\int \\cos{\\left(u \\right)}\\,du \\).",
