      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "The limits change with the variable: x = 0 gives u = 4 and x = 1 gives u = 5, so the integral is \\( 3\\left[\\sin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{4}^{5} \\).",
         "point_type_id": "BC-PT-99003",
         "rule_named": "limits converted to u"
